                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.02497/2611.02497v1/images/main_fig/hardware.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Robot platforms and hardware configurations.From left to right: Bimanual-YAM, SO-101, Franka in the DROID configuration, and Unitree G1, shown from the front and rear. Annotations identify cameras, grippers, computing equipment, and supporting hardware. These platforms span bimanual manipulation, low-cost and research-grade single-arm manipulation, and humanoid manipulation with locomotion. Observation and action specifications are standardized within each embodiment to support compatible policies across evaluation sites.",
